title: "Authorization_construction (Osaka Fork Types (ethereum/execution-specs))"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_set_chain_id: chain_id = U256
    q_set_chain_id --> q_set_address: address = Address
    q_set_address --> q_set_nonce: nonce = U64
    q_set_nonce --> q_set_y_parity: y_parity = U8
    q_set_y_parity --> q_set_r: r = U256
    q_set_r --> q_set_s: s = U256
    q_set_s --> [*]: Authorization dataclass defined
    note right of q_set_s
        INV-001: Authorization is used for EIP-7702 set-code transactions
        INV-002: chain_id must match the target chain for replay protection
        INV-003: (y_parity, r, s) form a valid ECDSA signature over the authorization tuple
        INV-004: nonce must match the current nonce of the authorizing account
    end note
